# Read by silica-session (silica-packages) before starting Ossido. Empty by default: the
# session picks its own defaults. Machine-specific overrides go in drop-ins:
# /etc/silica/session.env.d/*.env (the boot test uses one).
#
# OSSIDO_ARGS            extra arguments for ossido (e.g. --control 7991)
# SILICA_RENDERER        renderer of the shell's embedders (e.g. software)
